I left out both additions. This node's declared interfaces are only `aap:caps/inference-llm`, and the crate is a `wasm32-unknown-unknown` component with no WASI, so it has no filesystem to append to. The metadata fetch would need an `http-client` import, which the node doesn't declare. It would also send the selection's text, which is adversarial feed data, to an external host. Granting those capabilities or adding that egress needs a change to the node's declared interfaces and an explicit review, not a body change. Operations should raise these as a separate request.

